---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CtaBlock from '../components/CtaBlock.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About ZeisWorks"
  description="ZeisWorks is run by Jack Zeis in Golden, Colorado. The audit does the analysis, the team executes, and Jack reviews every plan personally."
  businessSchema={true}
>
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 pt-16 sm:pt-24 pb-16">
    <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight mb-10">
      A real person owns your plan.
    </h1>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-8 items-start">
      <img
        src="/jack.jpg"
        alt="Jack Zeis"
        class="w-36 h-36 rounded-2xl object-cover border border-cream-dark shrink-0"
        width="144"
        height="144"
        loading="eager"
      />
      <div class="space-y-5 text-ink-mid leading-relaxed text-[1.0625rem]">
        <p>
          ZeisWorks is run by Jack Zeis, a marketing and systems consultant based in Golden, Colorado. Jack has spent the last decade building revenue systems: search, ads, websites, CRMs, and the tracking that ties it all together, for businesses from local service companies to national firms.
        </p>
        <p>
          Here's how we work. The audit does the analysis. The plan lays out the work. Our team executes it. And Jack reviews every plan and every account personally, so nothing ships on autopilot and nobody gets handed off to a stranger.
        </p>
        <p>
          We keep it month to month on purpose. If the numbers don't justify the next month, you shouldn't pay for it. That's the deal.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CtaBlock heading="Five minutes from now you'll know where the leaks are." />
</BaseLayout>
